{"fw_ld7_pwa_0015","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim|world=vehicle",{1,"That car alarm's been going for an hour, I can't stand it",2,"It'll stop when the battery dies",1,"It's drawing them like flies!",2,"Then let's go the other way, away from the alarm, it's all we can do"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0016","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=sad|world=vehicle,door,road",{1,"Every car on the highway's empty, doors open, keys still in them",2,"Where did everybody go?",1,"I don't know, they just got out and walked off",2,"Or got pulled off, I don't want to think about it"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0017","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim|world=vehicle,cars",{1,"Check the trunks, there's gotta be something",2,"Like what?",1,"Water, a spare jacket, a tire iron, anything",2,"Okay, but quick, quick, I don't like being out here with all these empty cars"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0018","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear",{1,"Somebody's knocking, don't open it",2,"What if it's a neighbor?",1,"What if it isn't?! DON'T OPEN IT!",2,"Who is it? Say your name! Say your NAME!"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0019","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=door",{1,"Lock the door, LOCK IT!",2,"It is locked!",1,"Put something against it, the chair, the table, anything!",2,"It's moving, the whole door's moving, oh God, oh God"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0020","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=door",{1,"Check the back door, did anybody check the back door?",2,"I thought you did",1,"I thought YOU did!",2,"Go, go, go, both of you, now, if it's open we're- GO!"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0021","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=window",{1,"Stay away from the window",2,"I just want to look",1,"Don't look, don't even stand near it, they see movement",2,"Okay, okay, I'm crawling, I'm crawling to the other room"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0022","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=window",{1,"There's a face at the window, there's a face at the WINDOW!",2,"Where?",1,"Right there, right there, he's pressing his- he's just standing there, looking at me!",2,"Get away from the glass, get away, get AWAY"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0023","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim|world=window",{1,"Could we cover that window? I'd feel less exposed",2,"We don't have a blanket",1,"A coat might do. We can look for something",2,"All right. Let's see what we've actually got"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0024","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear",{1,"Glass just broke, something broke glass in the back!",2,"Was it a bird?",1,"Birds don't break glass at three miles an hour, something's inside!",2,"Stay together, stay behind me, get the poker, get anything"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0025","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=window",{1,"Don't look out the window, don't look",2,"Why? What's there?",1,"Just don't, I'm serious, don't look",2,"Now I HAVE to look"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0026","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=stairs,building",{1,"Upstairs, go upstairs, everybody upstairs",2,"They can climb stairs, can't they?",1,"Don't ask me that, I don't want to know, go go go",2,"Barricade the top, push the dresser, push it"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0027","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=inside",{1,"I once tried to hide in a closet. Kept waving everybody in",2,"Room for how many?",1,"Not enough. I was so scared I just kept saying squeeze",2,"You'd want a way out too. Not just a door you could shut"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0028","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"I keep worrying our voices will carry outside",2,"Then take a breath. You're scaring me more than the talking",1,"What?",2,"Just talk low, normal, like we're watching TV. I miss that"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0029","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=sad|world=building",{1,"It's too quiet in this house, listen to it",2,"I'll turn on the radio",1,"No, no radio, there's nothing on the radio",2,"Then hum something, I don't care, just fill it up"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0030","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"Check every room, check the kitchen, check the closets",2,"Why?",1,"Because I heard something, I know I heard something",2,"I'll start with the bedrooms, you take the hall, keep talking to me"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0031","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=stairs,building",{1,"Do they climb stairs? Does anybody know?",2,"I saw one on the porch steps",1,"Steps aren't stairs!",2,"They're all the same to somebody who's trying to eat you, I'd barricade it"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0032","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=fence",{1,"The fence won't hold, it's just chain-link, it's already bending",2,"We've got the other one, the back one",1,"How long before they find the back one?",2,"Stop, stop, I can't, I can't do that math"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0033","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=fence",{1,"Climb the fence, CLIMB, GO GO GO!",2,"I can't, I've got the baby, I can't climb!",1,"Hand her to me, hand her up, I've got her, I've got her!",2,"Don't drop her, DON'T DROP HER"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0034","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=fence",{1,"They're at the fence, they're all at the fence, there's like twelve of them",2,"Are they getting through?",1,"They're just pushing, they're all pushing, I think it's gonna go",2,"Then we go NOW, out the back, don't wait to see"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0035","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=trees",{1,"Something moved in the trees",2,"A deer",1,"It stood up, it stood up like a man",2,"Stop, stop talking, back away slowly, back away"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0036","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=trees,road",{1,"We should cut through the woods, stay off the road",2,"Are you crazy? You can't see anything in the woods!",1,"I don't know! I just want to get out of the open!",2,"And walk into something we can't see? Slow down. Think for a second"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0037","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=trees",{1,"A man just walked out of the tree line, he's carrying something",2,"What is it?",1,"Don't know, it's big, it's wrapped in a sheet, he's coming this way",2,"Don't let him close, tell him to stop, tell him to STOP"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0038","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim|world=trees",{1,"The woods are quiet, no birds",2,"I noticed",1,"Where'd the birds go? Why are the birds gone?",2,"They left, everything with sense left, we're the idiots still standing here"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0039","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim|world=water",{1,"The river's the only way out, maybe",2,"Boats are gone",1,"Raft, then, or tubes, or anything that floats",2,"Then we'll have to build something, how fast can you tie a knot?"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0040","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=water",{1,"Don't drink from the creek",2,"I'm so thirsty",1,"I saw something floating in it, upstream, don't ask, just don't drink it",2,"Then what do I drink? What do I drink?"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0041","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=sad",{1,"The fire's spreading to the next house, look",2,"Nobody's coming to put it out",1,"Should we try to?",2,"With what? A bucket? It's a whole row, it's gone, it's already gone"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0042","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=fire",{1,"That smoke makes me think of the Kroger fire. I remember seeing the column for miles",2,"I worried about what might gather near it",1,"I'm scared anything we do will bring them! I can't stop thinking about it!",2,"Then let's look for a way away from the smoke without rushing blind"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0043","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=calm|world=rain",{1,"I keep hoping the rain will cover us. I'm probably fooling myself",2,"I don't know what it hides",1,"So we keep watching the way back?",2,"Yeah. I was really hoping you'd say we could relax"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0044","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=rain",{1,"We're soaked, we're all soaked through, my teeth won't stop chattering",2,"Get inside somewhere, anywhere",1,"There's nowhere, every place is full of them or full of people with guns!",2,"Then we keep walking, we walk until we find something, keep moving, keep your blood moving"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0045","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=generator",{1,"If we use a generator, I'm going to worry about who hears it",2,"And I'd worry about food spoiling without one",1,"I know. Wanting it quiet doesn't switch it off or solve the food problem",2,"We'd have to check what we actually had before arguing about running it. God, I miss quiet"}},
{"fw_ld7_pwa_0046","panic_days",2,"reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=0,4|mood=grim",{1,"Would climbing a shed help us look ahead?",2,"And then what, jump?",1,"I just want to see which way to go. I know height isn't a whole escape plan",2,"Then we'd need to check it could hold us and a way down before anybody climbs"}},
